        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jason Lee, Kevin Smith, Scott Mosier\n- Films: Mallrats, Chasing Amy, Dogma, Jay and Silent Bob Strike Back, Jersey Girl, Clerks II, Cop Out\n- Organizations: View Askew Productions\n- Concepts: View Askewniverse\n\nFacts:\n- Jason Lee is known for roles in Kevin Smith films including \"Mallrats,\" \"Chasing Amy,\" \"Dogma,\" \"Jay and Silent Bob Strike Back,\" \"Jersey Girl,\" \"Clerks II,\" and \"Cop Out.\"\n- Kevin Smith's films often feature crossover plot elements, character references, and a shared canon.\n- Fans describe the shared canon of Kevin Smith's films as the \"View Askewniverse.\"\n- The \"View Askewniverse\" is named after View Askew Productions.\n- Kevin Smith co-founded View Askew Productions with Scott Mosier.",
